This license applies to the contents of the `data-external/` directory.

`prices_2023.csv` is derived from the Energy-Charts day-ahead spot market
price data for Germany
(https://energy-charts.info/charts/price_spot_market/chart.htm?l=en&c=DE),
published by Fraunhofer ISE, which in turn republishes data originally
sourced from Bundesnetzagentur / SMARD.de. The Energy-Charts API states,
per request:

  "CC BY 4.0 (creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0) from Bundesnetzagentur
  | SMARD.de"

and per its terms of use:

  "Unless stated otherwise, the data provided by the Energy-Charts API is
  licensed under the CC BY 4.0 license. Proper attribution to
  Energy-Charts.info as the source is required."
  (https://api.energy-charts.info/)

See README.md in this directory for exact reproduction steps.

Attribution: Bundesnetzagentur / SMARD.de, via Fraunhofer ISE / Energy-Charts.info.

